{"unit_id":"YLifeOnlyOnce__dsh-inline-visuals#card-zh","repo":"YLifeOnlyOnce/dsh-inline-visuals","commit":"c22d0f1d4955169aaa55f62c109eed795fad3c6f","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"Inline Visuals 是面向 DSH 网页客户端的对话可视化插件。它注册 show_visual 和 edit_visual 工具，把图表规格保存到工具结果，并由客户端在对话工具卡片及回答末尾渲染。支持柱状、折线、散点、热力图、时间线、流程图、混淆矩阵、训练曲线和 KPI 等多种形式，也可修改已有图表、提供文本摘要和导出数据。适合希望在会话中查看、比较和回放数据图形的用户；安装后无需额外配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/host/index.js:64-96","src/host/index.js:98-138","src/client/index.js:54-73","src/host/limits.js:4-22"]}
{"unit_id":"YLifeOnlyOnce__dsh-inline-visuals#card-en","repo":"YLifeOnlyOnce/dsh-inline-visuals","commit":"c22d0f1d4955169aaa55f62c109eed795fad3c6f","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Inline Visuals adds charts to DSH web conversations. show_visual creates visuals and edit_visual revises them; specs persist in tool results. The client renders charts, heatmaps, timelines, flows, and KPI cards, then shows the final visual beneath the reply. Installation needs no extra setup.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/host/index.js:64-96","src/host/index.js:98-138","src/client/index.js:54-73","src/host/limits.js:4-22"]}
