{"unit_id":"YLifeOnlyOnce__dsh-inline-visuals#feature-1","repo":"YLifeOnlyOnce/dsh-inline-visuals","commit":"c22d0f1d4955169aaa55f62c109eed795fad3c6f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Inline Visuals 的功能「生成对话图表」：调用 show_visual 并提供类型、标题和数据，即可生成图表、矩阵、时间线、流程图或指标卡；规格经过规范化后保存在工具结果中。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/host/index.js:64-96","src/host/normalize.js:30-61"]}
{"unit_id":"YLifeOnlyOnce__dsh-inline-visuals#feature-2","repo":"YLifeOnlyOnce/dsh-inline-visuals","commit":"c22d0f1d4955169aaa55f62c109eed795fad3c6f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Inline Visuals 的功能「修改已有图表」：对话中调用 edit_visual 并提交部分字段，插件会基于最近或指定工具调用的图表合并修改，再验证新规格。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/host/index.js:98-138","src/host/patch.js:7-31"]}
{"unit_id":"YLifeOnlyOnce__dsh-inline-visuals#feature-3","repo":"YLifeOnlyOnce/dsh-inline-visuals","commit":"c22d0f1d4955169aaa55f62c109eed795fad3c6f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Inline Visuals 的功能「回答中回放最终图形」：客户端记录每轮成功的可视化结果，并在回答末尾显示该轮最新图形，避免连续修改时重复展示中间版本。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/turn.js:24-56","src/client/turn.js:60-75","src/client/index.js:65-73"]}
{"unit_id":"YLifeOnlyOnce__dsh-inline-visuals#feature-4","repo":"YLifeOnlyOnce/dsh-inline-visuals","commit":"c22d0f1d4955169aaa55f62c109eed795fad3c6f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Inline Visuals 的功能「无图形客户端文本摘要」：工具输出同时生成简明文本表示；不显示可视化卡片的客户端也能读取数据摘要。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/host/index.js:81-88","src/host/text.js:150-170"]}
